OL,3,GNEWSAAnimal cruelty rises over the
OL,4,Asummer - charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn animal welfare charity has described
OL,7,Fa "busy summer" with animals being left
OL,8,Foutside in direct sunlight, with no
OL,9,Fwater, during heatwaves.
OL,11,FIt comes as the RSPCA revealed it had
OL,12,Fseen a "massive" increase in summer
OL,13,Fcruelty over the last five years.
OL,15,FAt the charity's vet hospital in
OL,16,FBirmingham, rescue officer Cara Gibbon
OL,17,Fsaid: "This summer we have seen an
OL,18,Fincrease in dogs being outside,
OL,19,Funfortunately, with no shade, no water
OL,20,Fand overall people have been struggling
OL,21,Fmore with getting their animals to the
OL,22,Fvets."
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
