OL,3,GNEWSAAnimal cruelty rises over the
OL,4,Asummer - charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast year, the RSPCA received 6,322
OL,7,Fcruelty calls to its emergency line
OL,8,Fduring the summer, compared to 3,852
OL,9,Fcalls for the same period in 2021 - an
OL,10,Fincrease of 64%.
